    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Munhū kūgwa mu shibi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike ī nzoka yalī masala sala kūjiheeba pyī ī shiinū ja mu matogolo ī jingī, ījo walī wajibeeja ū SEEBA Mulungu. Yūmūja ū nkīma gīkī, “Angū ng'hana gete ū Mulungu wahaya, ‘Mutizūlya matwajo ga ntī gose gose ū mu ngūnda?’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū nkīma wīwīla ī nzoka gīkī, “A matwajo ga mitī ya mu ngūnda tūdūgije ū kūgalya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mulungu wahaya gīkī, ‘Yaya ū kūlya a matwajo ga ntī ūyo gūlī ha gatī ya ngūnda; yaya nūūlū kūgakuumya, nguno mukūcha!’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī nzoka yūnshokeja ū nkīma gīkī, “Ndūhū gete, mutūcha! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu amanile dūhū gīkī ūlū ng'ūlya, a miso ging'we gakūkundūlīlwa, mubize gīt'umo alī ū Mulungu, ning'we mukwīmana ī misoga nī mibi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū nkīma aho wabona gīkī a matwajo ga ntī gwenūyo gawiza ū kūshilīwa, nū mu miso galībeela, nīyo gashikile kūng'winha munhū masala, ūtonola ūlya. Nū ngoshi, nū ng'wene ūng'winha ūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna a bose būbīlī wabo a miso gabo gūkundūlīlwa, bideeba gīkī balī dūūhū; būtunganīja madūūtū ganti ntiini, gīkī bibeegeje shizwalo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwimanīla mu makanza ga līīmi lyaheeha, ū Adamu nū nke būliigwa ī lilaka lya ng'wa SEEBA Mulungu akūyeelaga ū mu ngūnda. Ū Adamu nū nke būng'wibisa ū SEEBA Mulungu, mu mitī ya mu ngūnda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū SEEBA Mulungu ūng'witana ū Adamu gīkī, “Ūlī halī?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ūhaya, “Naaliigwa ī lilaka lyako ū mu ngūnda nogoha nibisa, nguno nalī dūūhū!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu ūng'wīla, “Nani ūyo wakūwīlaga gīkī ūlī dūūhū? Wagalyaga a matwajo ga ntī ayo nakakūlemeja kūgalya?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Adamu ūhaya, “Ū nkīma ūyo waninhile gīkī ikale hamò naane, h'ūyo walī waninha nūlya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA Mulungu ūng'wīla ū nkīma gīkī, “Bebe mhayo kī ū gwenūyū wagwītaga?” Nang'hwe ū nkīma ūhaya, “Lyalī lyanilemba ī liyoka nūlya!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūzung'wa Kwa Nzoka",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū SEEBA Mulungu wīwīla ī nzoka gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūzung'wa kwa banhū",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Mulungu ūng'wīla ū nkīma gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Munhū kūpeejiwa mu ngūnda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Adamu ūng'wilīka ū nke wakwe lina lya Eva, nūlūgīkī, Hawa, nguno h'uyo akabiza nina wa bapanga bose. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ū SEEBA Mulungu ūbabeegeja shizwalo sha makūnza ū Adamu nū nke, ūbazwīka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanuma ū SEEBA Mulungu ūhaya gīkī, “Ī haha ū munhū wabizaga gītī ūmò wise, wīmanaga ī misoga nī mibi. Na lūūlū ītigeleelilwe agasole na a matwajo ga ntī gwa būpanga agalye, abize mpanga welelo bose.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū ū SEEBA Mulungu ūmpeeja ū mu ngūnda gwa Edeni; ūūkabiza nīmi wayo ī sī īyo akabeejiwa kūfuma muyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 3:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wampeeja ūtūūla bamalaika Balang'hani akakitanagwa makelubi",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3:24",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Makelubi:",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Nūūlū, bamalaika balang'hani.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ū kū kīya ya ngūnda gwa Edeni, na līlūshū lya moto lya kwikala līkūgalūkaga hose hose būlī kwene, kwīlang'hana ī nzīla ya kūja ha ntī gwa būpanga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.3.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.3.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
